Z||000003||theogre||12-20-2001||05:13 PM||||That article is one of the few realy realy good ones to come out of that publication. I was very impressed with it and suprised by what they found. I was most impressed by how the Port Authority improved evacuations after the first bombing. I really expected them to just pay lip service to improvements like usually happens in government.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
